Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.68,0:00:08.32,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,1200,6440,7640)\pos(640,365.4)}Episode 21
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.68,0:00:08.32,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,1200,6440,7640)\pos(640,567.6)}The Battle of Guāndù - Part One
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.08,0:00:33.72,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,In the fourth year of the Jian'an era, 200 CE,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.72,0:00:36.39,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Sun Ce of Eastern Wu passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.39,0:00:39.78,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,His younger brother, Sun Quan, succeeded him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.34,0:00:44.30,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Sun Quan improved relations with Cao Cao,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.30,0:00:49.52,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,and declined to join Yuan Shao in conquering him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.20,0:00:58.28,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(283.2,459.2)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1720,2080)}Yuán Shào\NStyled: Běnchū
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.62,0:01:03.36,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,In the fifth year of the Jian'an era, August 201 CE,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.36,0:01:07.20,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Yuan Shao raised a force of\N 700,000 against Cáo Cāo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.20,0:01:12.55,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Thus began the famous battle of Guandu in history.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.42,0:01:34.77,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Let Sun Quan reject my goodwill. He does not matter either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.29,0:01:40.32,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,With a mighty host like this, \Nwho in the world could resist us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.30,0:01:45.34,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Report, sire!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.34,0:01:47.64,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Cao Cao has raised 70,000 men in response!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.64,0:01:49.38,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,He has set up camp at Guandu!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.92,0:01:51.68,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,His vanguard is heading towards us!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.55,0:01:59.90,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Cao Ahman overestimates himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.68,0:02:04.84,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,He thinks 70,000 men \Ncan vanquish our 700,000 host?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.84,0:02:08.83,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Is he not striking a stone with but an egg?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.90,0:02:21.19,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Have the entire army hasten their march!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.78,0:02:24.84,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,I will finish this in one battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.07,0:02:29.04,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}My lord, you must not be hasty and rush to war!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.53,0:02:34.00,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}My army is unstoppable! Why the dispute?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.36,0:02:40.58,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Sire, we may have more soldiers, \Nbut our morale cannot match theirs!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.58,0:02:44.06,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The foe may be elite, \Nbut their supplies cannot match ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.06,0:02:46.56,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}With our abundant supplies, we ought to fortify.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.82,0:02:50.81,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}If we wait, they will disperse without a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.42,0:02:55.96,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}If we rush into battle, we fall into Cao Cao's grasp!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.19,0:03:08.84,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,My lord, you need to reconsider this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.84,0:03:12.58,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Tián Fēng has already hurt our morale and will rot in his imprisonment!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.58,0:03:16.22,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Our army is about to march, \Nyet you want to demoralize us like he did?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.22,0:03:18.04,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Such outrage!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.55,0:03:21.84,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,If you fail to take heed of frank words, we will lose the war!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.42,0:03:26.24,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Men, take him away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.03,0:03:30.23,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Make sure you have this disturber...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.01,0:03:31.88,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Executed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.02,0:03:32.73,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.88,0:03:33.05,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(838.4,403.2)}Jǔ Shòu
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.88,0:03:33.05,That one frame,,0,0,0,,{\pos(800,503.6)}沮授
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.24,0:03:34.58,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,All forces, heed me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.92,0:03:36.86,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,If you fail to take frank advice,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.86,0:03:38.08,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,we will lose the war!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.08,0:03:39.69,Default,Zhang He,0,0,0,,My lord, wait, my lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.38,0:03:44.00,Default,Zhang He,0,0,0,,To kill our own before a battle will damage our morale!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.34,0:03:47.20,Default,Zhang He,0,0,0,,Imprison him for now and pass judgment later!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.20,0:03:49.66,Default,Gao Lan,0,0,0,,My lord, General Zhang's advice makes sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.66,0:03:52.18,Default,General,0,0,0,,You can still pass judgment after we have won!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.43,0:04:00.66,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Confine Ju Shou to the military prison for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.66,0:04:04.46,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,After I defeat Cao Cao, I will sentence him and Tian Feng together!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.46,0:04:04.84,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.23,0:04:07.86,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,Sire, if you fail to listen to frank words,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.86,0:04:10.47,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,we will lose the war, my lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.52,0:04:17.46,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,All forces, accelerate your advance!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.78,0:04:22.42,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Our 700,000 host shall split into east and west camps!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.06,0:04:24.76,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,We shall block the enemy troops!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.80,0:04:38.78,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,Sire, if you fail to listen, our cause will be lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.58,0:04:42.58,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,My lord, if you fail to listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.58,0:04:44.50,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,we will lose the war!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.78,0:04:47.66,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,My lord, if you fail to listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.66,0:04:49.95,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,we will lose the war!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.28,0:05:35.84,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1160,1560)\pos(963.4,432.6)}Cáo Cāo\NStyled: Mèngdé
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.40,0:05:46.96,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,0,2160,2560)\pos(938.2,455.4)}Guō Jiā\NStyled: Fèngxiào
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.81,0:05:52.90,Default,Guo Jia,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Chancellor, why are you still watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.57,0:05:59.16,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Yuan Shao has great momentum on his side.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.16,0:06:04.46,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I thought he would go on the offensive, \Nyet he formed a line of shields in the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.86,0:06:06.97,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}His intention is to defend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.62,0:06:10.60,Default,Guo Jia,0,0,0,,{\bord12)}Yuan Shao can afford to defend, \Nbut you, Chancellor, can not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.07,0:06:16.52,Default,Guo Jia,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Our men are elite, equal to ten of his. We must attack fast to shatter morale and break even.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.62,0:06:22.44,Default,Guo Jia,0,0,0,,{\bord12)}If we stall, our supplies will run out. I only fear for what comes then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.45,0:06:40.14,Default,Guo Jia,0,0,0,,{\bord12}If we are to withstand 700,000 foes with 70,000 men, you must act decisively.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.14,0:06:42.90,Default,Guo Jia,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The slightest hesitation will unnerve our army!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.02,0:07:25.02,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,Stern,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Yuan Shao!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.49,0:07:29.63,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,Stern,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I asked the Emperor to make you Grand General!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.16,0:07:32.20,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,Stern,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}How could you stoop to rebellion?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.10,0:07:34.92,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,Angry,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}You may be the Chancellor of the Han,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.92,0:07:36.80,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,Angry,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}but you are its most vile traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.80,0:07:38.90,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,Angry,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}How rich of you to accuse me of rebellion!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.90,0:07:40.64,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,Angry,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Your crimes cover the Heavens!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.99,0:07:44.92,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,Stern,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I am under Imperial order to quell all rebels!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.10,0:07:47.70,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,Angry; Arrogant,{\bord12}And I have the imperial blessing \Nto quell all villains!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.97,0:07:56.22,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,Insane; Arrogant,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.64,0:07:57.68,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,Stern,Sound the drums!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.53,0:08:48.32,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.59,0:09:27.08,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Exterminate the traitors!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.26,0:09:54.94,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,My lord, Cao Cao fled back to his camp at Guāndù!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.38,0:09:58.81,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,He fled to Guāndù?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.87,0:10:03.06,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Guāndù is the chokepoint to Xǔdū.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.06,0:10:06.96,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Cao Cao seeks to grab my army's very throat with this move
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.96,0:10:09.19,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,and stop us from advancing to Xǔchāng.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.46,0:10:11.91,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,How clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.46,0:10:16.21,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Have all forces press onward to Guandu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.21,0:10:18.37,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Order the troops to harass them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.37,0:10:20.98,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Do not give Cao Cao any respite,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.98,0:10:23.12,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,lest he stabilize his position.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.94,0:10:25.58,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Whoever possesses Guandu
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.40,0:10:29.58,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,will be in a good position to take Xuchang as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.39,0:10:31.78,Default,Shen Pei,0,0,0,,My lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.78,0:10:34.86,Default,Shen Pei,0,0,0,,I believe we can send\N ten thousand men to blockade Guandu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.86,0:10:38.02,Default,Shen Pei,0,0,0,,Have your troops siege them, build dirt towers,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.02,0:10:40.77,Default,Shen Pei,0,0,0,,and shoot arrows into the camps.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.68,0:10:43.40,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2400,2680)\pos(976.6,440.4)}Shěn Pèi\N Styled: Zhèngnán
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.06,0:10:48.98,Default,Shen Pei,0,0,0,,If we keep harassing Cao Cao until he retreats, we can seize the chokepoint,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.98,0:10:51.52,Default,Shen Pei,0,0,0,,and Xuchang will be within our grasp!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.88,0:10:53.82,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,An excellent strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.82,0:10:55.04,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Heed my orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.17,0:11:01.74,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,All regiments, select your best soldiers\N and trap Cao Cao at Guandu by building dirt towers!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.25,0:11:05.85,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Some say Cao Cao is a great commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.85,0:11:09.24,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Let us make sure he cannot advance or retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.83,0:11:10.56,Default,Generals,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.36,0:12:09.32,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1640,1960)\pos(277.8,481.2)}Xún Yōu\NStyled: Gōngdá
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.76,0:12:19.06,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Bring it! Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.61,0:12:32.76,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.54,0:12:37.82,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Eat eat eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.66,0:12:40.49,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.07,0:12:49.84,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Patrol captain, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.90,0:13:17.76,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.29,0:13:50.16,Default,Liu Ye,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.74,0:13:53.58,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Did Wenruo send a letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.40,0:13:56.12,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1360,1720)\pos(280.8,491)}Liú Yè\NStyled: Zǐyáng
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.82,0:14:02.48,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The stalemate at Guandu has lasted over a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.48,0:14:08.40,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Though both sides have victories and losses, Yuan Shao has more soldiers and provisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.84,0:14:12.35,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}If this continues, our morale will collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.66,0:14:16.95,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Right now, I have left Xuchang empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.61,0:14:23.98,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12}If Yuan Shao sends some of his troops to attack it, how can we resist him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.84,0:14:32.91,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Since we are at a major disadvantage...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.54,0:14:41.93,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}What if I were to leave early...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.99,0:14:48.54,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Prepare my army for a proper attack at later day?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.78,0:15:01.80,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Much has been said from me, so what is with your silence?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.85,0:15:06.84,Default,Liu Ye,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Chancellor, I came here to propose the usage of "Thunder Mangonels,"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.84,0:15:08.84,Default,Liu Ye,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}but I did not expect you...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.07,0:15:10.20,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.18,0:15:14.52,Default,Liu Ye,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I did not expect Chancellor to think of fleeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.53,0:15:24.30,Default,Liu Ye,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Chancellor, consider this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.30,0:15:28.32,Default,Liu Ye,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}We have 70,000 soldiers who can resist 700,000 men.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.32,0:15:35.34,Default,Liu Ye,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The stalemate has lasted over a month, yet Chancellor has not been displaced by his larger army!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.34,0:15:40.63,Default,Liu Ye,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Is this not a sign that Yuan Shao's army will never get past us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.73,0:15:45.76,Default,Messenger,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.42,0:15:48.42,Default,Messenger,0,0,0,,I have come back from Xuchang
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.42,0:15:50.42,Default,Messenger,0,0,0,,with a letter from Xun Yu!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.47,0:16:08.96,Default,Xun Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12)}"Yuan Shao has assembled his whole army at Guandu, to make a last stand against you."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.96,0:16:14.29,Default,Xun Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"Sire has to match with weak against the strong, "If you cannot outmaneuver him, he will win."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.29,0:16:16.97,Default,Xun Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"This moment will decide the fate of all."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.62,0:16:21.05,Default,Xun Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"Though Shao's army is grand, he cannot use it."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.05,0:16:24.70,Default,Xun Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12)}"With your divine might and wisdom, however will you fail?"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.40,0:16:28.08,Default,Xun Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"Though our army is small, \N we have set our borders.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.08,0:16:30.52,Default,Xun Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"Hold onto the chokepoint to stymie the advance"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.52,0:16:32.90,Default,Xun Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"Soon, the tide will begin to turn in haste."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.90,0:16:36.32,Default,Xun Yu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"To strike with surprise at this moment is most vital."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.26,0:16:42.57,Thinking,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"We have set our borders..."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.57,0:16:45.39,Thinking,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"Hold onto the chokepoint to stymie their advance"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.12,0:16:50.12,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"The tide will begin to turn in haste"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.15,0:16:55.38,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"To strike with surprise at this moment is most vital."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.38,0:16:59.38,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Indeed, the moment is vital!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.16,0:17:03.36,Default,Cao Hong,0,0,0,,Chancellor, what does Xun Yu suggest we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.74,0:17:06.07,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Fortify Guandu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.47,0:17:10.30,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Hold onto the chokepoint to stymie their advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.33,0:17:22.07,Default,Cao Hong,0,0,0,,But with the conditions before us...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.95,0:17:31.35,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,The stalemate at Guandu has lasted over a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.35,0:17:34.10,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,As was said, "the tide will begin to turn."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.28,0:17:40.43,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,If we maintain this position and seize every available opportunity,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.43,0:17:45.60,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,then it is just as sir Xun Yu summarized, in four words, "the tide will turn."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.61,0:17:51.88,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,For now, we must stabilize our army and raise our morale.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.09,0:17:54.96,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,But first, Sir Ziyang has a schematic to show.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.50,0:17:57.56,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Sir Ziyang?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.03,0:18:02.81,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(885.333,40)}"Thunder Mangonel Schematic"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.40,0:18:27.20,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Come up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.76,0:18:53.61,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Put your back to it, let that bastard taste steel!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.61,0:18:56.84,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,But he's two or three hundred feet away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.86,0:19:11.57,Default,Li Dian,0,0,0,,Chancellor, may I?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.68,0:19:18.88,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1900,1200)\pos(983.6,491.4)}Lǐ Diǎn \NStyled: Mànchéng
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.26,0:19:18.88,Default,Li Dian,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.73,0:19:50.40,Default,Li Dian,0,0,0,,Advance!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.68,0:20:42.00,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Who is outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.22,0:20:44.98,Default,Liu Ye,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.98,0:20:45.52,Default,Xun You,0,0,0,,My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.52,0:20:47.92,Default,Xun You,0,0,0,,We must invite ourselves in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.38,0:20:50.70,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Why are you two covered in dirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.71,0:20:54.82,Default,Liu Ye,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Chancellor,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.82,0:20:58.23,Default,Liu Ye,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}we spotted the foe digging a hole behind some hills.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.23,0:21:01.60,Default,Liu Ye,0,0,0,,{\bord12}They couldn't beat us openly,\N and so now they try with stealth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.60,0:21:04.99,Default,Liu Ye,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The hole was a tunnel dug to sneak into our camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.22,0:21:12.03,Default,Xun You,0,0,0,,{\bord12\}Fear not, Chancellor, for Sir Liu Ye told the camp to surround the hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.68,0:21:16.32,Default,Xun You,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Thus, the enemy wasted resources on that tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.80,0:21:24.84,Default,Xun You,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Chancellor, our provisions are about to run out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.18,0:21:34.36,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I am about to write to Wenruo about this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.82,0:21:38.50,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I will ask him to amass grain in Xuchang
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.50,0:21:41.68,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,and transport it here overnight to relieve the army.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.95,0:21:46.26,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Chancellor, General Xu Huang wants to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.72,0:21:49.60,Default,Xu Huang,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.16,0:21:52.44,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Gongming, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.14,0:21:56.26,Default,Xu Huang,0,0,0,,Chancellor,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.26,0:21:58.10,Default,Xu Huang,0,0,0,,when my subordinate, Shi Huan, patrolled,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.28,0:21:59.48,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1800,2200)\pos(317,490)}Xú Huǎng\NStyled: Gōngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.10,0:21:59.85,Default,Xu Huang,0,0,0,,he captured a spy of Yuan Shao.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.85,0:22:01.06,Default,Xu Huang,0,0,0,,After interrogation,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.06,0:22:05.85,Default,Xu Huang,0,0,0,,we found out that Yuan Shao told General \NHan Meng to deliver food to relieve his army!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.09,0:22:16.10,Default,Xun You,0,0,0,,Han Meng is but a brave fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.10,0:22:19.54,Default,Xun You,0,0,0,,If we send out a few thousand light cavalry
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.54,0:22:21.32,Default,Xun You,0,0,0,,to intercept him,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.32,0:22:24.08,Default,Xun You,0,0,0,,we will sever their supply line and disrupt their army.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.24,0:22:28.46,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.46,0:22:32.32,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Gongming, lead your personal forces out first.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.00,0:22:36.73,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I will have Zhang Liao and \NXu Chu to reinforce you shortly after.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.73,0:22:41.18,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Once you steal Yuan Shao's supplies, he may order soldiers to rescue them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.18,0:22:45.00,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Then, you may strike from each side in a pincer attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.00,0:22:46.78,Default,Xu Huang,0,0,0,,I will prepare immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.78,0:22:47.80,Default,Xu Huang,0,0,0,,I take my leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.22,0:23:11.14,Default,Han Meng,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.43,0:23:13.84,Default,Han Meng,0,0,0,,We must reach the main camp before daybreak!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.76,0:23:13.16,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2000,2400)\pos(967.6,478.6)}Hán Měng
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.44,0:24:20.00,Default,Gao Lan,0,0,0,,Who's the officer before us?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.56,0:24:22.48,Default,Han Meng,0,0,0,,Generals Zhang and Gao!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.48,0:24:24.10,Default,Han Meng,0,0,0,,If you came just a bit earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.10,0:24:26.21,Default,Han Meng,0,0,0,,would the food have been seized?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.99,0:24:29.91,Default,Gao Lan,0,0,0,,If the defeated soldiers didn't report the seizure,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.91,0:24:31.92,Default,Gao Lan,0,0,0,,would our lord have us rescue you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.92,0:24:32.82,Default,Zhang He,0,0,0,,Enough bickering!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.82,0:24:35.36,Default,Zhang He,0,0,0,,While Xu Huang is still close by, let's kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.60,0:24:36.40,Default,Han Meng,0,0,0,,Very good!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.34,0:24:38.03,Default,Officer,0,0,0,,General, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.34,0:24:43.82,Default,Gao Lan,0,0,0,,Stabilize the formation!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.82,0:24:44.71,Default,Gao Lan,0,0,0,,I'll meet them!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.86,0:24:52.57,Default,Han Meng,0,0,0,,No! We've been surrounded by the traitors!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.87,0:25:15.55,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,You had your supplies seized!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.43,0:25:18.44,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,How do you still have the gall to face me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.29,0:25:20.95,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Men!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.95,0:25:21.43,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.37,0:25:24.04,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Take him out and behead him!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.04,0:25:24.64,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.64,0:25:25.34,Default,Han Meng,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.74,0:25:28.43,Default,Han Meng,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.00,0:25:34.02,Default,Shen Pei,0,0,0,,My lord, our supplies have just been seized.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.02,0:25:36.00,Default,Shen Pei,0,0,0,,Our morale is shaken!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.00,0:25:38.65,Default,Shen Pei,0,0,0,,Killing our main general would only worsen it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.84,0:25:40.57,Default,General,0,0,0,,My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.78,0:25:45.18,Default,General,0,0,0,,My lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.18,0:25:48.14,Default,General,0,0,0,,General Han has fought fiercely for us before.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.14,0:25:49.78,Default,General,0,0,0,,Who knew Cao Cao was this sly?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.78,0:25:53.10,Default,General,0,0,0,,Please spare him and let him redeem himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.85,0:25:57.26,Default,All,0,0,0,,Please, my lord, spare him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.88,0:26:09.24,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,I will show you mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.46,0:26:15.64,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Get out of my sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.64,0:26:16.73,Default,Han Meng,0,0,0,,Thank you my lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.54,0:26:41.35,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Now that our supplies have been stolen,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.35,0:26:44.31,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,do any of you have a strategy in response?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.86,0:26:50.22,Default,Shen Pei,0,0,0,,My lord, all of our grain is stored at Wuchao.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.22,0:26:52.22,Default,Shen Pei,0,0,0,,We must send forces there to secure it,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.22,0:26:54.00,Default,Shen Pei,0,0,0,,lest any unforeseen events occur.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.20,0:26:58.28,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,I have already planned that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.70,0:27:02.35,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Go to Ye Commandery to supervise the supply lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.35,0:27:06.08,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Ensure they are maintained so we will not lack grain.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.49,0:27:09.60,Default,Shen Pei,0,0,0,,Yes, I obey!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.96,0:27:15.72,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Chunyu Qiong?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.72,0:27:16.33,Default,Chunyu Qiong,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.70,0:27:22.26,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Wuchao is our main granary.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.26,0:27:24.62,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,It must be protected with heavy forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.62,0:27:27.82,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,You will lead the forces towards Wuchao.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.82,0:27:30.76,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Make sure each man defends it carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.76,0:27:31.56,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Do not fail me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.48,0:27:33.36,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1540,1880)\pos(300.2,497)}Chúnyú Qióng\NStyled: Zhòngjiān
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.56,0:27:32.02,Default,Chunyu Qiong,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.34,0:27:38.16,Default,Friendly Guard,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.01,0:27:39.98,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.55,0:27:43.51,Default,Friendly Guard,0,0,0,,Ju Shou wants to talk to you about an urgent matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.51,0:27:44.36,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.87,0:27:48.08,Default,Friendly Guard,0,0,0,,Sir Ju says it's a critical military matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.08,0:27:49.36,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,I do not care!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.36,0:27:50.25,Default,Friendly Guard,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.45,0:28:16.14,Default,Friendly Guard,0,0,0,,Sir, you're in shackles and stocks,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.14,0:28:18.39,Default,Friendly Guard,0,0,0,,no longer a strategist by our lord's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.46,0:28:21.22,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,Please tell me what happened now!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.22,0:28:23.20,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,I promise to reward you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.25,0:28:25.58,Default,Friendly Guard,0,0,0,,I'm only a simple soldier,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.58,0:28:27.60,Default,Friendly Guard,0,0,0,,how could I take such a gift?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.38,0:28:30.55,Default,Friendly Guard,0,0,0,,If you want to listen, I'll talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.76,0:28:34.94,Default,Friendly Guard,0,0,0,,General Han Meng was escorting our grain,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.94,0:28:38.25,Default,Friendly Guard,0,0,0,,but was intercepted along the way and lost it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.46,0:28:41.74,Default,Friendly Guard,0,0,0,,Our lord has sent Sir Shen to Ye
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.74,0:28:43.41,Default,Friendly Guard,0,0,0,,to supervise the supply lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.88,0:28:47.15,Default,Friendly Guard,0,0,0,,He also sent Chunyu Qiong to defend Wuchao.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.59,0:28:53.66,Default,Friendly Guard,0,0,0,,Sir, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.95,0:28:54.60,Default,Friendly Guard,0,0,0,,Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.46,0:29:01.04,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,I need to tell our lord that disaster is approaching!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.19,0:29:30.70,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,My lord, I only have a few things to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.70,0:29:33.04,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,Please allow me to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.20,0:29:36.02,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,There is nothing happening today,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.02,0:29:37.12,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,so I can humor you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.44,0:29:40.02,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,How can you say that there's nothing happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.02,0:29:42.20,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,Disaster is about to strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.19,0:29:53.46,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,My lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.79,0:29:58.20,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,I have followed you for many years.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.20,0:30:00.34,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,Now that disaster is about to strike,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.34,0:30:06.72,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,I beg you to heed me just this once!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.78,0:30:18.90,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,It is because you have served me for years
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.90,0:30:21.00,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,that you get to see me at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.00,0:30:24.08,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Rise quickly and say what is on your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.82,0:30:25.64,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.40,0:30:31.84,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,My lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.84,0:30:33.78,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,in matters of war,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.78,0:30:35.40,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,supplies are important.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.92,0:30:38.76,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Do I need you to remind me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.76,0:30:41.94,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,But even though they are so important,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.94,0:30:44.66,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,you have barely given thought to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.66,0:30:45.59,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.61,0:30:49.22,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,Han Meng's provisions have been stolen,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.22,0:30:52.55,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,and now, Wuchao is in grave danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.05,0:31:00.74,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,I have already sent Chunyu Qiong to secure it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.74,0:31:02.02,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,My lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.02,0:31:04.28,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,the problem is exactly that!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.67,0:31:07.42,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,You are still in prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.30,0:31:12.16,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Military matters are none of your concern!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.93,0:31:16.81,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,It is common knowledge to prioritize supplies in war!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.81,0:31:19.31,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,I sent our best to defend them a long time ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.13,0:31:21.38,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}My lord...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.24,0:31:25.48,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Chunyu Qiong loves alcohol as much as his own life.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.48,0:31:28.71,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Decadent and witless,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.71,0:31:30.96,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}he is drunk for days at a time!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.96,0:31:34.00,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}He is a dullard, the most incompetent among all!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.26,0:31:37.32,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,{\bord12)}How can you entrust \Nsuch a great task to him, sire!?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.03,0:31:45.30,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Men.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.30,0:31:46.12,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.68,0:31:54.30,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,Take this brazen fool away, let him rot in jail!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.25,0:31:55.80,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.80,0:31:57.10,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Add more shackles!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.10,0:31:58.27,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,Sire! My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.27,0:32:00.23,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,He will not be released without my orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.23,0:32:00.71,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.71,0:32:03.78,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,I risk death to warn you of an imminent disaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.78,0:32:05.23,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,You must come to your senses!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.23,0:32:05.98,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.98,0:32:06.40,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.40,0:32:07.74,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.04,0:32:09.43,Default,Ju Shou,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.56,0:32:12.06,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Convey my orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.06,0:32:14.66,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,I want his guard put to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.66,0:32:15.98,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Replace him!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.98,0:32:16.68,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.59,0:32:24.66,Default,Xu You,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.68,0:32:26.60,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(961.6,486.4)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1580,1920)}Xǔ Yōu\NStyled: Zǐyuǎn
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.45,0:32:27.12,Default,Xu You,0,0,0,,Where are you taking him?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.28,0:32:28.88,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,To answer, Sir Xu,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.88,0:32:31.68,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,the patrols have detained this suspicious person.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.68,0:32:33.74,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,He claims to be a merchant,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.74,0:32:36.96,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,but we found a letter from \NCao Cao to Xuchang on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.96,0:32:39.24,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,We are going to bring him before our lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.07,0:32:41.69,Default,Xu You,0,0,0,,A spy of Cao Cao?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.43,0:32:44.54,Default,Xu You,0,0,0,,Where is the letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.78,0:32:45.54,Default,Xu You,0,0,0,,Let me see!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.86,0:32:57.99,Default,Xu You,0,0,0,,I must report this military development myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.60,0:33:05.36,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,In this campaign, we must obliterate Cao Cao at Guandu. Thoughts-?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.58,0:33:07.34,Default,Xu You,0,0,0,,My lord! My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.34,0:33:09.18,Default,Xu You,0,0,0,,I have great news, very great news!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.18,0:33:12.44,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Sir Xu, what great news have you so elated?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.83,0:33:14.82,Default,Xu You,0,0,0,,It is indeed great news!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.82,0:33:16.68,Default,Xu You,0,0,0,,We can destroy Cao Cao in one battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.22,0:33:18.84,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Please tell me more, Sir Xu!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.20,0:33:29.65,Default,Guo Tu,0,0,0,,My lord, we take our leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.87,0:33:39.58,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.54,0:33:43.11,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Sir Xu, please explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.40,0:33:46.50,Default,Xu You,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Sire,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.50,0:33:50.25,Default,Xu You,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Cao Cao has maintained\N his army at Guandu to hold us off.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.25,0:33:52.29,Default,Xu You,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}With this, Xuchang is unguarded!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.29,0:33:55.46,Default,Xu You,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}If we send a regiment to raid Xuchang at night,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.46,0:33:58.16,Default,Xu You,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}then we can capture Xuchang and even Cao Cao too!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.62,0:34:04.72,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Master Xu, how do you know they are running out of supplies?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.72,0:34:10.62,Default,Xu You,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The patrols have captured one of his spies. Here is the secret message from Cao Cao,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.62,0:34:12.94,Default,Xu You,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}he is urging Xuchang to transport supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.34,0:34:16.91,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Pass it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.88,0:34:43.11,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Cao Cao is man of dastardly schemes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.58,0:34:46.50,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Perhaps this letter is designed to lure our army.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.28,0:34:48.64,Default,Xu You,0,0,0,,My lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.89,0:34:52.37,Default,Xu You,0,0,0,,we will suffer in the future \Nif we do not take Xuchang.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.22,0:34:56.93,Default,Xu You,0,0,0,,While Cao Cao is indeed devious, this letter cannot be discredited.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.17,0:35:01.68,Default,Xu You,0,0,0,,My lord, you cannot waste this chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.97,0:35:04.36,Default,Xu You,0,0,0,,I, Xu You, swear my life on this!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.92,0:35:14.96,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,How are you so sure that this is not a trap set by Cao Cao?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.48,0:35:23.86,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Mister Xu, how do you know\N Cao Cao's thoughts so well?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.98,0:35:26.00,Default,Xu You,0,0,0,,My lord...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.00,0:35:26.96,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.37,0:35:30.21,Default,Xu You,0,0,0,,How could I dare jest during warfare?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.58,0:35:37.18,Default,Xu You,0,0,0,,Cao Cao's letter is very clear! His army is too feeble from low supplies to defend Guandu!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.18,0:35:38.87,Default,Xu You,0,0,0,,How could it be false?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.66,0:35:41.52,Default,Xu You,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.52,0:35:45.32,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,My lord, I have a letter from \NYe Commandery by Shen Pei!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.32,0:35:46.04,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.04,0:35:46.47,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.92,0:35:49.68,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"Upon your orders, I am at Ye to supervise supplies."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.68,0:35:52.71,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"They will arrive soon, assuaging your worries."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.71,0:35:54.58,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"My lord, there is another issue."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.58,0:35:55.75,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"When Xu You..."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.16,0:36:00.36,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.36,0:36:01.18,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.18,0:36:04.40,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"When Xu You was in Ji Province, he plundered people's property."
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.40,0:36:08.18,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,{\bord12)}"Furthermore, he had his nephews embezzle taxes and food."
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.18,0:36:09.84,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"Thus, I have arrested them."
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.36,0:36:12.86,Default,Xu You,0,0,0,,My lord, Shen Pei is slandering me!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.86,0:36:14.67,Default,Xu You,0,0,0,,Do not believe his words!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.31,0:36:25.91,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}You are one devious fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.47,0:36:30.44,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}How can you face me and present any strategy?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.85,0:36:36.18,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I am well aware that you and Cao Cao are old friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.10,0:36:38.66,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Perhaps...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.79,0:36:42.72,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}You accepted bribes from him!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.72,0:36:46.60,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,{\bord12}You tried to deceive me into dividing my forces, ensuring my defeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.60,0:36:48.88,Default,Xu You,0,0,0,,I... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.88,0:36:52.81,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Sir Xu, what is the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.92,0:36:54.36,Default,Xu You,0,0,0,,Shen Pei is slandering me...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.70,0:36:55.60,Default,Xu You,0,0,0,,Shen Pei is slandering me...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.60,0:36:58.45,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,I should behead you for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.98,0:37:02.97,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,You may keep your head for a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.67,0:37:04.46,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Guards?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.46,0:37:04.88,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.71,0:37:07.50,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Drag him out! Drag him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.50,0:37:08.04,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.95,0:37:12.58,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Ban him from seeing me ever again!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.58,0:37:13.04,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.02,0:37:18.74,Default,Xu You,0,0,0,,Shen Pei is slandering me...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.33,0:37:20.95,Default,Xu You,0,0,0,,Shen Pei is slandering me...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.20,0:37:24.46,Default,Xu You,0,0,0,,Shen Pei is slandering me...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.95,0:37:35.37,Thinking,Xu You,0,0,0,,The truths of the loyal are too much to heed for fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.37,0:37:39.01,Thinking,Xu You,0,0,0,,Yuan Shao ignores honest advice, \NCao Cao will defeat him for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.61,0:37:41.59,Thinking,Xu You,0,0,0,,Then why not submit to Cao Cao?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.52,0:38:15.07,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Damn animal, there's not enough for us yet you waste all your food.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.28,0:38:25.24,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,If you weren't our lord's horse, I would...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.12,0:38:39.62,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.65,0:38:43.57,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Please report that the patrols found this gentleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.57,0:38:45.28,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,He says he has to meet the Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.28,0:38:48.16,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,The Chancellor was planning \Nwith his generals all night long.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.16,0:38:50.32,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,He just went to sleep. Report after he wakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.16,0:38:54.24,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,This man says it's an urgent matter, it cannot wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.24,0:38:55.60,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,What are you blathering?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.60,0:38:57.12,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,No one must wake the Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.02,0:39:02.56,Default,Xu You,0,0,0,,Mengde!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.06,0:39:04.22,Default,Xu You,0,0,0,,Mengde!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.22,0:39:05.60,Thinking,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Who is shouting outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.41,0:39:08.88,Default,Xu You,0,0,0,,I, Xu You of Nanyang, wish to come!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.69,0:39:21.98,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.33,0:39:25.47,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Very good!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.57,0:39:31.72,Default,Xu You,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Sir, you are the Chancellor, while I am a commoner. You need not be so courteous.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.65,0:39:35.92,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,No, no, no! Come, come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.94,0:39:44.16,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}We are just friends! Why mention paltry ranks?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.16,0:39:46.66,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Come! Come! Hurry up! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.46,0:39:49.67,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.14,0:39:52.70,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,After you!

